      "objective": "Repair the one-way LLDP configuration by enabling receive on Birch uplink. Apply the settings and explicitly send advertisements from Cedar and Birch so each uplink records its directly attached peer as current. Preserve every other global and port setting, both chassis/port identities, and the live physical link. Configuration changes alone do not populate neighbor caches.",
