      "simplifications": "Offline typed LLDP point-to-point simulation only; no real packets, IOS CLI, CDP, bridge forwarding or automatic transmission scheduler. Simulated time and advertisements are explicit. Historical caches do not prove current delivery. Development fixture only, not a bundled lesson or objective promotion.",
